---
// The start page's four steps, side by side on a wide screen and stacked on
// a phone. Each step is a <Step>, whose prose comes from the page so Vale
// checks it.
---

<ol class="flow not-content"><slot /></ol>

<style>
  .flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0;
    margin-block: 2rem;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: step;
  }
</style>
